## Incamake y'Ubushakashatsi — Ntare Rushatsi (Ep. 1, verusiyo ya masaha 2)

Nasoje gusuzuma amasoko yose ari muri uyu mushinga. Inkuru nziza: nabonye isoko rishasha rikomeye kandi ritari muri BBG.docx — igitabu ca Jean-Pierre Chrétien *"Burundi: L'histoire retrouvée"* (1993) gifise ikiganiro cihariye kuri "Ntare, umuvyeyi w'igihugu" (*"Le mwami Ntare, le héros fondateur d'une protonation"*), harimwo:

- **Inkuru yuzuye ya Ruvugazinaniwe** (umutangankuru yavuze iyi nkuru inshuro ebiri — 1954 na 1979, imyaka 25 hagati) — ni yo mvano y'inkuru twari dusanganywe (Ntwero, Jabwe, Nsoro, Ruhaga, Kibuguzo, Umwina w'intambwe, Inkoma)
- **Ikibazo gikomeye c'abahinga**: Vansina na Chrétien bavuga ko hashobora kuba hariho **Ba-Ntare babiri batandukanye**: Ntare Karemera (ikinjana ca 16, avuye i Bugesera) na Ntare Rushatsi (impera y'ikinjana ca 17, avuye i Buha binyuze ku Nkoma) — 🟡/🔴 ikibazo gikomeye dukwiye kwerekana neza
- Amakuru arambuye ku bigabiro (amashamba matagatifu), uko Karyenda yubatswe, isano ya Kiranga n'ubwami, n'ahantu hashinzwe abami ba kera (Nkiko-Mugamba n'ahandi)

