## Umushinga w'ibice (Ep 1A – 1J), hafi amasaha 2 (≈15,000-17,000 y'amajambo yo gusoma)

| Igice | Umutwe | Impuzu |
|---|---|---|
| **1A** | Intango — Ikibazo c'amateka (Aba-Ntare babiri?) | ~10' |
| **1B** | Ntwero — umwana w'imvura | ~10' |
| **1C** | Jabwe na Nsoro — gusangira ingoma, guhemuka | ~12' |
| **1D** | Ku Buha — Ruhaga, Namabuye, Cambarantama | ~14' |
| **1E** | Inkoma — Karyenda n'ivuka ry'ubwami | ~12' |
| **1F** | Ntare ku ngoma — kwica Jabwe, ivyiyumviro vy'imigenzo | ~12' |
| **1G** | Kiranga n'idini ry'ubwami | ~10' |
| **1H** | Ibimenyetso mu gihugu — ibigabiro, amabuye, ivyabonetse | ~10' |
| **1I** | Urupfu, imva, umurage | ~10' |
| **1J** | Umwanzuro + itangazo rya Ep. 2 | ~5' |

**Ikibazo dukeneye gufata ingingo:** Ntugishaka ko iyi verusiyo ihuza ibice 1A-1J muri **dokima imwe nyinshi** (script imwe y'amasaha 2), canke ushaka **buri gice mu dokima yaco** (10 files zitandukanye)?

Ndabandanya nkora, ariko mbere yuko nirungika ntanga umwanya: reka ndondere script ku bice bike bitangura (1A-1C, ~30 min), ndakwereke uko byifashe, hanyuma nkomeze n'ibisigaye — canke urashaka nkore vyose hamwe ku mugambi umwe (nzokora mu bihe bibiri/bitatu kubera uburebure)?
